                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Please note the states with the top 10 highest child-care costs appear to proportionally lower incomes. It can also be determined that every year the income remains relatively stagnant; however, child-care costs continue to rise. There is also a noticeable increase in costs, the younger the child. The subsidies can taper down as the dependent child becomes school aged. </run>
